Version: 1.2
desc: calfNXT Stereo
tags: processing stereo mid-side utility
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  A stereo utility. Input levels and a mode matrix (LR to LR, LR to MS, MS to LR, LR to LL, LR to RR, LR to L+R mono and
  LR to RL), mid and side level, mid pan and side balance, an optional high-band side decorrelator (all-pass chain behind a
  Linkwitz-Riley crossover), channel mute and polarity flip, a channel delay of up to 20 ms, stereo base, stereo phase
  rotation and output balance. A goniometer and correlation meter show the output field.
  Ported from the Stereo in calfNXT by Markus Schmidt (https://calfnxt.org), GNU GPL 3.
  JSFX version released under GPLv3 license
  Claude generated some of this code
